title: D4 ExamSession (status and grading_status)
---
%% UML 2.5 state machine. Transition label syntax: trigger [guard] / effect.
%% Source: session/domain/ExamSession.java, ExamDraftService, ExamPublishService, SessionStateService,
%% SessionAutoOpenWorker, SessionAutoCloseWorker, SessionRevocationService
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DRAFT : / host creates a draft
  DRAFT --> READY : prepare exam and audience
  READY --> READY : prepare again
  READY --> SCHEDULED : publish / register audience
  SCHEDULED --> OPEN : when(now >= opens_at) / SessionAutoOpenWorker opens
  SCHEDULED --> OPEN : open [actor = host]
  OPEN --> CLOSED : when(now >= closes_at) / SessionAutoCloseWorker closes
  OPEN --> CLOSED : close [actor = host]
  READY --> CANCELLED : cancel [actor = host]
  SCHEDULED --> CANCELLED : cancel [actor = host]
  SCHEDULED --> CANCELLED : subscription revoked
  CANCELLED --> [*]

  state CLOSED {
    [*] --> UNFROZEN
    UNFROZEN --> FROZEN : freezeGrading [actor = host]
    FROZEN --> COMPLETED : completeGrading [all attempts graded]
    COMPLETED --> [*]
  }
  note right of CLOSED
    Nested region for grading_status.
    UNFROZEN means the column is null, not an enum value.
  end note
